WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.797
"Brain Invader is probably controlling those soldiers," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:04.798 --> 00:00:06.713
"I don't want to hurt them."

3
00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:13.265
Suddenly a giant skunk crashed through the entrance.

4
00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:16.442
Psshh! It sprayed the soldiers.

5
00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:18.721
They held their noses and ran.

6
00:00:18.722 --> 00:00:19.984
"Yuck!"

7
00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:23.365
"Run for your lives!"

8
00:00:23.366 --> 00:00:27.760
"The skunk is huge!" Roxy thought.

9
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:33.863
Roxy hurried into the building and saw Brain Invader.

10
00:00:33.864 --> 00:00:38.101
She held up the device. "I'm here to cure you!"

11
00:00:38.102 --> 00:00:40.548
Brain Invader didn't say anything.

12
00:00:40.549 --> 00:00:44.448
Roxy scratched her head. "Why aren't you talking?"

13
00:00:44.449 --> 00:00:49.625
The villain made a fist. "I'm trying to talk in your head!"

14
00:00:49.626 --> 00:00:53.389
Roxy laughed. "That won't work now.

15
00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:58.300
My steel suit blocks your power!" She shot toward the villain.

16
00:00:58.301 --> 00:01:02.072
Crash! Private Benson smashed through a wall.

17
00:01:02.073 --> 00:01:04.654
She stomped after Roxy.

18
00:01:04.655 --> 00:01:09.246
Splat! Splat! Mighty Man shot slime.

19
00:01:09.247 --> 00:01:14.911
Roxy zigzagged to avoid it.

20
00:01:14.912 --> 00:01:18.022
Then she felt a big hand grab her foot.

21
00:01:18.023 --> 00:01:23.698
"You can't escape, Rocket Girl!" Private Benson said.

22
00:01:23.699 --> 00:01:25.638
Roxy kicked and kicked.

23
00:01:25.639 --> 00:01:27.976
But Private Benson didn't let go.

24
00:01:27.977 --> 00:01:31.238
Splat! Slime hit Roxy.

25
00:01:31.239 --> 00:01:35.077
"Grr!" Roxy slowly moved toward Brain Invader.

26
00:01:35.078 --> 00:01:37.728
Private Benson held on.

27
00:01:37.729 --> 00:01:39.744
More slime hit Roxy.

28
00:01:39.745 --> 00:01:41.961
Her feet stuck to the floor.

29
00:01:41.962 --> 00:01:44.787
Brain Invader was still far away.

30
00:01:44.788 --> 00:01:49.385
Splat! Slime pinned Roxy's left arm to her side.

31
00:01:49.386 --> 00:01:51.793
She held up the device with her free hand.

32
00:01:51.794 --> 00:01:53.762
Roxy pressed a trigger.

33
00:01:53.763 --> 00:01:55.765
Mist shot from the device.

34
00:01:55.766 --> 00:01:59.056
She blew her super breath. Whoosh!

35
00:01:59.057 --> 00:02:04.616
The mist flew toward Brain Invader.

36
00:02:04.617 --> 00:02:07.395
The villain took off his mask.

37
00:02:07.396 --> 00:02:11.610
He looked confused. "What's going on?"

38
00:02:11.611 --> 00:02:16.905
Private Benson let go of Roxy. "Sorry, Rocket Girl!"

39
00:02:16.906 --> 00:02:21.248
"Brain Invader controlled us," the Mighty Man actor said.

40
00:02:21.249 --> 00:02:27.356
"I know." Roxy freed herself from the slime.

41
00:02:27.357 --> 00:02:32.044
She looked at the general. "What's the last thing you remember?"

42
00:02:32.045 --> 00:02:33.984
General Waltz scratched his head.

43
00:02:33.985 --> 00:02:39.187
"Um, I remember Old Misty erupting."

44
00:02:39.188 --> 00:02:45.183
The next morning Roxy returned to Dr. Chen's lab.

45
00:02:45.184 --> 00:02:48.663
Dr. Chen looked happy.

46
00:02:48.664 --> 00:02:56.410
"I cured the skunk. I also cured Private Benson and Mighty Man.

47
00:02:56.411 --> 00:03:00.215
They don't remember anything."

48
00:03:00.216 --> 00:03:04.737
"Great," Roxy said. "I guess things are normal again."

49
00:03:04.738 --> 00:03:07.720
"The cure will work on you too, Rocket Girl."

50
00:03:07.721 --> 00:03:09.900
Dr. Chen held the device.

51
00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:12.905
"You can be a normal kid if you want."

52
00:03:12.906 --> 00:03:16.022
"Really?" Roxy said.

53
00:03:16.023 --> 00:03:18.237
Thoughts filled her head.

54
00:03:18.238 --> 00:03:21.446
"I could have more fun with my friends . . ."

55
00:03:21.447 --> 00:03:26.442
But then she remembered times when she saved her friends—and others.

56
00:03:26.443 --> 00:03:30.728
"Only Rocket Girl can do that," she thought.

57
00:03:30.729 --> 00:03:32.553
Roxy shook her head.

58
00:03:32.554 --> 00:03:36.230
"No thanks, Dr. Chen. I'm not normal.

59
00:03:36.231 --> 00:03:43.468
I'm Rocket Girl—and people need me!"

